  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-27T02:46:00.054Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "You removed sitting in your own avatar seat because it 'causes unintended behavior' and 'makes it hard for world creators to keep control of their creations'. These two things do that too, might as well remove them. People can still climb over walls and clip through walls with these two things, so you should remove them. \n\nSomeone was jumping in my map and climbing over barriers, and a FBT user was clipping through walls to see things you can only see if you find the hidden button! This was just SO angering and I think you should remove jumping and FBT to FULLY remedy the 'issues' caused by sitting in your own station.\n\n#bringbackselfsitting",
